{
  "category": "Puppet Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "SHUPPET is attracted by feelings of jealousy and vindictiveness. If someone develops strong feelings of vengeance, this POKéMON will appear in a swarm and line up beneath the eaves of that person’s home.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SHUPPET grows by feeding on dark emotions, such as vengefulness and envy, in the hearts of people. It roams through cities in search of grudges that taint people.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "This POKéMON roams about deep in the night seeking such negative emotions as grudges and envy. It retreats to its nest when the sun begins to rise.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves to feed on feelings like envy and malice. Its upright horn catches the emotions of people.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves to feed on feelings like envy and malice. Its upright horn catches the emotions of people.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice, or so it’s said. It’s very active at night.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice, or so it’s said. It’s very active at night.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice-- or so it’s said. It’s very active at night.",
      "version": "x"
