    {
      "text": "Shuppet is attracted by feelings of jealousy and vindictiveness. If someone develops strong feelings of vengeance, this Pokémon will appear in a swarm and line up beneath the eaves of that person’s home.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shuppet grows by feeding on dark emotions, such as vengefulness and envy, in the hearts of people. It roams through cities in search of grudges that taint people.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It eats up emotions like malice, jealousy, and resentment, so some people are grateful for its presence.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "There’s a proverb that says, “Shun the house where Shuppet gather in the growing dusk.”",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
